window.STARESTO_V04_BANK={"metadata":{"usage":"非商業教育用途；保留來源及作者權利聲明，不得視為 GPL／通用開源授權","origin":"https://github.com/staresto-create/JCEE-vocab-questions"},"questions":[{"id":"sv-V0091","sourceId":"V0091","category":"vocab","year":89,"exam":"學測","stem":"Jack is a ______ person: he is polite, kind, and always shows respect for others.","translation":"傑克是個彬彬有禮的人：他既有禮貌又善良，總是尊重他人。","options":{"A":"courteous","B":"handsome","C":"hateful","D":"sensitive"},"answer":"A","explanation":"Jack is a ___ person；be courteous to sb（對某人以禮相待）｜adj. 有禮貌的, 彬彬有禮的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0092","sourceId":"V0092","category":"vocab","year":89,"exam":"學測","stem":"The traffic in the city was ______ today, so Jane got home earlier than usual.","translation":"今天市區的交通很順暢，所以珍比平常更早到家。","options":{"A":"heavy","B":"weak","C":"scarce","D":"light"},"answer":"D","explanation":"The traffic in the city was ___ today；heavy／light traffic（交通壅塞／順暢）｜adj. 輕的, 少量的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0093","sourceId":"V0093","category":"vocab","year":89,"exam":"學測","stem":"Jonathan had qualified as a doctor but later gave up the ______ of medicine for full-time writing.","translation":"強納森取得了醫師資格，但後來放棄行醫，全職投入寫作。","options":{"A":"treatment","B":"diagnosis","C":"practice","D":"consumption"},"answer":"C","explanation":"gave up the ___ of medicine；the practice of medicine／law（行醫／執業當律師）｜n. 執業, 業務","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0094","sourceId":"V0094","category":"vocab","year":89,"exam":"學測","stem":"Bill was severely punished because he ______ lied to his mother.","translation":"比爾因為故意對母親說謊而受到嚴厲的處罰。","options":{"A":"notoriously","B":"purposefully","C":"roughly","D":"strongly"},"answer":"B","explanation":"he ___ lied to his mother；lie to sb（對某人說謊，不可省略 to）｜adv. 故意地, 有目的地","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0095","sourceId":"V0095","category":"vocab","year":89,"exam":"學測","stem":"The two security guards will be ______ from all their duties until further investigation is completed.","translation":"這兩名保全人員將被暫停所有職務，直到進一步調查完成為止。","options":{"A":"collapsed","B":"measured","C":"declared","D":"suspended"},"answer":"D","explanation":"will be ___ from all their duties；be suspended from + N（被停職、被停學）｜v. 使停職, 暫停","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0096","sourceId":"V0096","category":"vocab","year":89,"exam":"學測","stem":"He made his instruction ______ and direct so that everyone could follow easily.","translation":"他把指示說得明確又直接，好讓每個人都能輕易理解遵循。","options":{"A":"tentative","B":"explicit","C":"plausible","D":"informal"},"answer":"B","explanation":"made his instruction ___ and direct；be explicit about + N（把…講清楚）｜adj. 明確的, 清楚的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0097","sourceId":"V0097","category":"vocab","year":89,"exam":"學測","stem":"In order for a new product to sell well, manufacturers often invest a large sum of money on its ______.","translation":"為了讓新產品暢銷，製造商常常投入大筆資金在推廣宣傳上。","options":{"A":"liberation","B":"promotion","C":"destruction","D":"concentration"},"answer":"B","explanation":"invest a large sum of money on its ___；sales promotion（促銷、產品宣傳）｜n. 促銷, 宣傳","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0098","sourceId":"V0098","category":"vocab","year":89,"exam":"學測","stem":"The soldier was put on trial for ______ to obey his commanding officer’s order.","translation":"這名士兵因拒絕服從指揮官的命令而被送上軍事審判。","options":{"A":"refusing","B":"regretting","C":"resigning","D":"restricting"},"answer":"A","explanation":"put on trial for ___ to obey；refuse to + V（拒絕做…，不接 V-ing）｜v. 拒絕, 回絕","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0099","sourceId":"V0099","category":"vocab","year":89,"exam":"學測","stem":"Since Michael was the best candidate, the committee voted ______ for him to take charge of the company’s sales department.","translation":"由於麥可是最佳人選，委員會一致投票通過由他負責公司的業務部門。","options":{"A":"anonymously","B":"drastically","C":"customarily","D":"unanimously"},"answer":"D","explanation":"the committee voted ___ for him；a unanimous decision（全體一致的決議）｜adv. 一致地, 全體一致地","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0100","sourceId":"V0100","category":"vocab","year":89,"exam":"學測","stem":"After hiking all day without drinking any water, the students sat down by the stream to quench their ______.","translation":"學生們健行一整天都沒喝水，於是坐在小溪邊解渴。","options":{"A":"hunger","B":"energy","C":"thirst","D":"nutrition"},"answer":"C","explanation":"to quench their ___；quench one's thirst（解渴）｜n. 口渴, 渴望","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0101","sourceId":"V0101","category":"vocab","year":89,"exam":"學測","stem":"The more one is ______ the English-speaking environment, the better he or she will learn the language.","translation":"一個人越常暴露在英語環境中，就越能學好這個語言。","options":{"A":"filled in","B":"exposed to","C":"caught on","D":"kept up"},"answer":"B","explanation":"one is ___ the English-speaking environment；be exposed to + N（接觸到、暴露在…之中）｜片語 暴露於, 接觸到","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0102","sourceId":"V0102","category":"vocab","year":89,"exam":"學測","stem":"Peter’s sudden death was a great blow to Jane and it took her a long time to ______ the grief.","translation":"彼得的驟逝對珍是一大打擊，她花了很長時間才走出悲傷。","options":{"A":"put out","B":"come across","C":"go round","D":"get over"},"answer":"D","explanation":"took her a long time to ___ the grief；get over the grief／an illness／a shock（走出、熬過，接的是傷痛或病痛這一類）｜片語 克服, 從...恢復","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0103","sourceId":"V0103","category":"vocab","year":89,"exam":"學測","stem":"A person who likes to ______ others is definitely not easy to get along with.","translation":"喜歡找別人麻煩的人，絕對不好相處。","options":{"A":"leave out","B":"let off","C":"pick on","D":"turn up"},"answer":"C","explanation":"A person who likes to ___ others；pick on sb（找某人麻煩，pick sb 是挑人）｜片語 找...麻煩, 欺負","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0104","sourceId":"V0104","category":"vocab","year":89,"exam":"學測","stem":"The old houses will soon be ______ and rebuilt because of the severe damage caused by the earthquake.","translation":"這些老舊房屋因地震造成的嚴重損害，很快就會被拆除重建。","options":{"A":"put out","B":"run down","C":"knocked out","D":"pulled down"},"answer":"D","explanation":"The old houses will soon be ___ and rebuilt；pull down and rebuild a house／an old building（拆除重建，講災後重建或都市更新）｜片語 拆除, 拆毀","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0105","sourceId":"V0105","category":"vocab","year":89,"exam":"學測","stem":"I’d like to thank you for your hospitality ______ our group.","translation":"我想代表我們這個團體，感謝您的盛情款待。","options":{"A":"on behalf of","B":"instead of","C":"because of","D":"as a result of"},"answer":"A","explanation":"your hospitality ___ our group；on behalf of + N（代表…）｜片語 代表","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0106","sourceId":"V0106","category":"vocab","year":90,"exam":"學測","stem":"The ballet dancers’ ______ movements delighted all the audience.","translation":"芭蕾舞者優雅的動作讓所有觀眾都感到欣喜。","options":{"A":"truthful","B":"doubtful","C":"graceful","D":"helpful"},"answer":"C","explanation":"｜adj. 優雅的, 優美的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0107","sourceId":"V0107","category":"vocab","year":90,"exam":"學測","stem":"At the closing ceremony of the Olympic Games, all the athletes ______ good-bye to the audience.","translation":"在奧運閉幕典禮上，所有選手都向觀眾揮手道別。","options":{"A":"charmed","B":"waved","C":"dared","D":"gazed"},"answer":"B","explanation":"athletes ___ good-bye to the audience；wave good-bye to sb（向某人揮手道別）｜v. 揮手, 揮動","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0108","sourceId":"V0108","category":"vocab","year":90,"exam":"學測","stem":"The drug problem is universal. It is not ______ to one country.","translation":"毒品問題是全球性的，並不侷限於某一個國家。","options":{"A":"protected","B":"detected","C":"admitted","D":"restricted"},"answer":"D","explanation":"It is not ___ to one country；be restricted to + N（侷限於…）｜adj. 受限制的, 有限的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0109","sourceId":"V0109","category":"vocab","year":90,"exam":"學測","stem":"I think that this new program will be ______ of your effort.","translation":"我認為這個新方案值得你付出努力。","options":{"A":"cautious","B":"fruitful","C":"worthy","D":"patient"},"answer":"C","explanation":"will be ___ of your effort；be worthy of + N（值得…）｜adj. 值得的, 值得尊敬的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0110","sourceId":"V0110","category":"vocab","year":90,"exam":"學測","stem":"This textbook is ______ more difficult to read than the other one.","translation":"這本教科書讀起來比另一本困難得多。","options":{"A":"considerably","B":"favorably","C":"desirably","D":"respectably"},"answer":"A","explanation":"is ___ more difficult to read；considerably／much + 比較級（…得多，very 不能修飾比較級）｜adv. 相當地, 大大地","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0111","sourceId":"V0111","category":"vocab","year":90,"exam":"學測","stem":"The ______ of Linda’s love for music made her fly to Vienna to enter a music school.","translation":"琳達對音樂的熱愛之強烈，使她飛往維也納進入一所音樂學校就讀。","options":{"A":"quantity","B":"intensity","C":"creativity","D":"formality"},"answer":"B","explanation":"｜n. 強烈, 緊張","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0112","sourceId":"V0112","category":"vocab","year":90,"exam":"學測","stem":"E-mail plays a ______ role in modern communication.","translation":"電子郵件在現代通訊中扮演著至關重要的角色。","options":{"A":"vital","B":"violent","C":"vivid","D":"various"},"answer":"A","explanation":"plays a ___ role in modern communication；play a vital role in + N（在…扮演關鍵角色）｜adj. 極其重要的, 必不可少的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0113","sourceId":"V0113","category":"vocab","year":90,"exam":"學測","stem":"I ______ accept your plan, but I think it should be somewhat reworded.","translation":"我基本上接受你的計畫，但我認為措辭應該稍作修改。","options":{"A":"basically","B":"leisurely","C":"modestly","D":"properly"},"answer":"A","explanation":"｜adv. 基本上, 主要地","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0114","sourceId":"V0114","category":"vocab","year":90,"exam":"學測","stem":"This poem may be ______ in several different ways and each of them makes sense.","translation":"這首詩可以有好幾種不同的解讀方式，而且每一種都說得通。","options":{"A":"negotiated","B":"designated","C":"interpreted","D":"substituted"},"answer":"C","explanation":"may be ___ in several different ways；interpret sth as + N（把…解讀成…）｜v. 解釋, 詮釋","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0115","sourceId":"V0115","category":"vocab","year":90,"exam":"學測","stem":"The ______ of this piece of cloth is too coarse. Do you have a finer one?","translation":"這塊布的質地太粗糙了，你有比較細緻的嗎？","options":{"A":"content","B":"display","C":"extent","D":"texture"},"answer":"D","explanation":"The ___ of this piece of cloth；the texture of skin／soil（膚質、土質，不限於布料）｜n. 質地, 質感","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0116","sourceId":"V0116","category":"vocab","year":90,"exam":"學測","stem":"His plan ______ in failure though it had been supported by many people.","translation":"儘管他的計畫得到許多人的支持，最終還是以失敗收場。","options":{"A":"held on","B":"ended up","C":"put away","D":"brought about"},"answer":"B","explanation":"His plan ___ in failure；end up + V-ing（最後落得…，不接 to V）｜片語 最終落得, 以…告終","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0117","sourceId":"V0117","category":"vocab","year":90,"exam":"學測","stem":"Sara enjoys amusing her friends by ______ stories.","translation":"莎拉喜歡編故事來逗朋友開心。","options":{"A":"speaking out","B":"setting off","C":"making up","D":"giving away"},"answer":"C","explanation":"amusing her friends by ___ stories；make up a story／an excuse（編故事、編藉口）｜片語 編造, 彌補","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0118","sourceId":"V0118","category":"vocab","year":90,"exam":"學測","stem":"As the applause ______, the curtain on the stage dropped slowly.","translation":"隨著掌聲漸漸平息，舞台上的布幕緩緩落下。","options":{"A":"took off","B":"died down","C":"passed out","D":"stayed up"},"answer":"B","explanation":"As the applause ___；noise／wind dies down（噪音、風勢漸漸平息）｜片語 逐漸平息, 漸漸減弱","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0119","sourceId":"V0119","category":"vocab","year":90,"exam":"學測","stem":"No one can possibly know ______ when an earthquake will strike.","translation":"沒有人能事先知道地震何時會發生。","options":{"A":"in advance","B":"in particular","C":"in vain","D":"in case"},"answer":"A","explanation":"can possibly know ___；know sth in advance／ahead of time（事先知道，也說 beforehand）｜片語 事先","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0120","sourceId":"V0120","category":"vocab","year":90,"exam":"學測","stem":"The scientist’s project to build a modern laboratory was ______ on account of its huge budget.","translation":"這位科學家興建現代化實驗室的計畫，因為預算龐大而遭到質疑。","options":{"A":"taken for granted","B":"started out","C":"got into difficulty","D":"called into question"},"answer":"D","explanation":"to build a modern laboratory was ___；call sth into question（對…提出質疑）｜片語 使受到質疑","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0121","sourceId":"V0121","category":"vocab","year":91,"exam":"學測","stem":"In the keen competition of this international tennis tournament, she ______ won the championship.","translation":"在這場競爭激烈的國際網球錦標賽中，她驚險地贏得了冠軍。","options":{"A":"privately","B":"distantly","C":"locally","D":"narrowly"},"answer":"D","explanation":"___ won the championship；narrowly win（險勝）｜adv. 勉強地, 差一點","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0122","sourceId":"V0122","category":"vocab","year":91,"exam":"學測","stem":"This company, with its serious financial problems, is no longer ______.","translation":"這間公司財務問題嚴重，已經到了無法掌控的地步。","options":{"A":"achievable","B":"stretchable","C":"repeatable","D":"manageable"},"answer":"D","explanation":"is no longer ___；manage to + V（設法做到…，不接 V-ing）｜adj. 易辦的, 易管理的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0123","sourceId":"V0123","category":"vocab","year":91,"exam":"學測","stem":"Your desk is crowded with too many unnecessary things. You have to ______ some of them.","translation":"你的書桌上堆滿了太多不必要的東西，你得移除一些才行。","options":{"A":"remain","B":"resist","C":"remove","D":"renew"},"answer":"C","explanation":"You have to ___ some of them；remove sth from + N（把…從…移開）｜v. 移除, 移開","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0124","sourceId":"V0124","category":"vocab","year":91,"exam":"學測","stem":"Most businessmen are more interested in the ______ success of their products than their educational values.","translation":"大多數商人對產品的商業成功更感興趣，而非其教育價值。","options":{"A":"cultural","B":"commercial","C":"classical","D":"criminal"},"answer":"B","explanation":"the ___ success of their products；commercial success（產品賣得好、賺到錢，business success 則是事業經營得成功）｜adj. 商業的, 商用的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0125","sourceId":"V0125","category":"vocab","year":91,"exam":"學測","stem":"The postal special ______ service is very efficient. A package sent can be received in a couple of hours.","translation":"郵局的限時專送服務非常有效率，寄出的包裹幾個小時內就能收到。","options":{"A":"delivery","B":"directory","C":"discovery","D":"dormitory"},"answer":"A","explanation":"The postal special ___ service；deliver a speech（發表演說，deliver 不只是送東西）｜n. 遞送, 運送","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0126","sourceId":"V0126","category":"vocab","year":91,"exam":"學測","stem":"Children don’t learn their native languages ______, but they become fluent in them within a few years.","translation":"孩子並不是刻意地學習母語，但他們在幾年內就能流利地使用。","options":{"A":"previously","B":"variously","C":"consciously","D":"enviously"},"answer":"C","explanation":"don’t learn their native languages ___；make a conscious effort（刻意去做某事）｜adv. 有意識地, 刻意地","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0127","sourceId":"V0127","category":"vocab","year":91,"exam":"學測","stem":"______ to what you think, our TV program has been enjoyed by a large audience.","translation":"與你想的相反，我們的電視節目其實深受廣大觀眾的喜愛。","options":{"A":"Intensive","B":"Contrary","C":"Fortunate","D":"Objective"},"answer":"B","explanation":"___ to what you think；contrary to + N／wh- 子句（與…相反）｜adj. 相反的, 矛盾的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0128","sourceId":"V0128","category":"vocab","year":91,"exam":"學測","stem":"There is a ______ to one’s capacity; one should not make oneself overtired.","translation":"一個人的能力是有限度的，不應該讓自己過度勞累。","options":{"A":"relaxation","B":"contribution","C":"hesitation","D":"limitation"},"answer":"D","explanation":"a ___ to one’s capacity；a limitation to + N（…有其限度）｜n. 限制, 缺陷","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0129","sourceId":"V0129","category":"vocab","year":91,"exam":"學測","stem":"It is necessary for you to ______ this point. We simply cannot understand it.","translation":"你有必要把這一點說清楚，我們實在無法理解。","options":{"A":"clarify","B":"falsify","C":"purify","D":"notify"},"answer":"A","explanation":"necessary for you to ___ this point；clarify a point（把某一點講清楚）｜v. 澄清, 闡明","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0130","sourceId":"V0130","category":"vocab","year":91,"exam":"學測","stem":"Our team will certainly win this baseball game, because all the players are highly ______.","translation":"我們的球隊一定會贏得這場棒球賽，因為所有球員都幹勁十足。","options":{"A":"illustrated","B":"estimated","C":"motivated","D":"dominated"},"answer":"C","explanation":"are highly ___；highly motivated（動力強、積極進取）｜adj. 積極的, 幹勁十足的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0131","sourceId":"V0131","category":"vocab","year":91,"exam":"學測","stem":"This story, ______, is very fascinating: there are many interesting characters in it.","translation":"整體而言，這個故事非常引人入勝：裡面有許多有趣的角色。","options":{"A":"on the whole","B":"under no circumstances","C":"in no time","D":"out of the question"},"answer":"A","explanation":"This story, ___, is very fascinating；on the whole（整體而言，等於 in general）｜片語 整體而言","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0132","sourceId":"V0132","category":"vocab","year":91,"exam":"學測","stem":"Most of our classmates are ______ taking a trip to Kenting National Park.","translation":"我們大多數同學都贊成去墾丁國家公園旅行。","options":{"A":"in honor of","B":"in favor of","C":"in search of","D":"in place of"},"answer":"B","explanation":"classmates are ___ taking a trip；be in favor of + N／V-ing（贊成…，不接 to V）｜片語 贊成, 支持","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0133","sourceId":"V0133","category":"vocab","year":91,"exam":"學測","stem":"We haven’t seen John for a long time. As a matter of fact, we have ______ him.","translation":"我們已經很久沒見到約翰了，事實上我們已經跟他失去聯絡了。","options":{"A":"made up for","B":"run out of","C":"come to pass","D":"lost track of"},"answer":"D","explanation":"we have ___ him；lose／keep track of + N（失去聯絡／掌握…的動向）｜片語 和…失去聯絡","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0134","sourceId":"V0134","category":"vocab","year":91,"exam":"學測","stem":"Recently in Taiwan, the manufacturing industry has ______ the information industry.","translation":"最近在台灣，製造業已經讓位給了資訊產業。","options":{"A":"found a way of","B":"changed the way of","C":"given way to","D":"had a way of"},"answer":"C","explanation":"has ___ the information industry；give way to + N（讓位給…、被…取代）｜片語 讓位給, 由…取代","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0135","sourceId":"V0135","category":"vocab","year":91,"exam":"學測","stem":"His behavior at the party last night seemed rather ______. Many of us were quite surprised.","translation":"他昨晚在派對上的行為顯得相當不合時宜，讓我們許多人都很驚訝。","options":{"A":"out of practice","B":"out of place","C":"out of politeness","D":"out of pity"},"answer":"B","explanation":"seemed rather ___；out of place（不得體、格格不入）｜片語 不恰當, 不合時宜","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0151","sourceId":"V0151","category":"vocab","year":92,"exam":"學測","stem":"All the flights to and from Kaohsiung were _____ because of the heavy thunderstorm.","translation":"由於強烈雷雨，往返高雄的所有班機都取消了。","options":{"A":"advised","B":"disclosed","C":"cancelled","D":"benefited"},"answer":"C","explanation":"｜v. 取消, 終止","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0152","sourceId":"V0152","category":"vocab","year":92,"exam":"學測","stem":"The woman told the truth to her lawyer without ____ because he was the only person she could rely on.","translation":"這名女子毫無保留地向律師說出真相，因為他是她唯一能依靠的人。","options":{"A":"reservation","B":"combination","C":"impression","D":"foundation"},"answer":"A","explanation":"told the truth to her lawyer without ___；without reservation（毫無保留地說，這個 reservation 是保留、疑慮的意思，不是訂位）｜n. 預訂, 保留","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0153","sourceId":"V0153","category":"vocab","year":92,"exam":"學測","stem":"The man was severely injured in last weekend’s tragic car accident and died _____ afterwards.","translation":"這名男子在上週末的悲慘車禍中身受重傷，不久後便過世了。","options":{"A":"mostly","B":"shortly","C":"easily","D":"hardly"},"answer":"B","explanation":"died ___ afterwards；shortly after + N／shortly afterwards（不久之後，這裡的 shortly 指時間上很快，不是簡短地）｜adv. 不久, 很快","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0154","sourceId":"V0154","category":"vocab","year":92,"exam":"學測","stem":"Mr. Smith’s work in Taiwan is just _____. He will go back to the U.S. next month.","translation":"史密斯先生在台灣的工作只是暫時的，他下個月就會回美國。","options":{"A":"liberal","B":"rural","C":"conscious","D":"temporary"},"answer":"D","explanation":"｜adj. 暫時的, 臨時的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0155","sourceId":"V0155","category":"vocab","year":92,"exam":"學測","stem":"Helen _____ with anger when she saw her boyfriend kissing an attractive girl.","translation":"海倫看到男友親吻一位漂亮女孩時，勃然大怒。","options":{"A":"collided","B":"exploded","C":"relaxed","D":"defeated"},"answer":"B","explanation":"Helen ___ with anger；explode with anger（勃然大怒，人當主詞的比喻用法，介系詞用 with）｜v. 爆炸, 爆發","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0156","sourceId":"V0156","category":"vocab","year":92,"exam":"學測","stem":"Dr. Liu’s new book is a collection of his _____ of the daily life of tribal people in Africa.","translation":"劉博士的新書是他對非洲部落人民日常生活觀察的集結。","options":{"A":"observations","B":"interferences","C":"preventions","D":"substitutions"},"answer":"A","explanation":"a collection of his ___ of the daily life；observations of + N（對…的觀察心得，指觀察所得時可數，多用複數）｜n. 觀察, 觀察結果","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0157","sourceId":"V0157","category":"vocab","year":92,"exam":"學測","stem":"The young couple decided to ______ their wedding until all the details were well taken care of.","translation":"這對年輕夫婦決定將婚禮延後，直到所有細節都安排妥當。","options":{"A":"announce","B":"maintain","C":"postpone","D":"simplify"},"answer":"C","explanation":"decided to ___ their wedding；postpone + N／V-ing（延後…）｜v. 延後, 延期","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0158","sourceId":"V0158","category":"vocab","year":92,"exam":"學測","stem":"The conflicts between John and his teacher made it difficult for the teacher to judge his performance _____.","translation":"約翰與老師之間的衝突，讓老師難以客觀地評斷他的表現。","options":{"A":"objectively","B":"painfully","C":"excitedly","D":"intimately"},"answer":"A","explanation":"｜adv. 客觀地","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0159","sourceId":"V0159","category":"vocab","year":92,"exam":"學測","stem":"Living in a highly _____ society, you definitely have to arm yourself with as much knowledge as possible.","translation":"生活在一個高度競爭的社會裡，你絕對需要盡可能地充實自己的知識。","options":{"A":"tolerant","B":"permanent","C":"favorable","D":"competitive"},"answer":"D","explanation":"Living in a highly ___ society；a highly competitive society（競爭激烈的社會，中文的「競爭」是名詞，這裡要用形容詞）｜adj. 競爭激烈的, 競爭的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0160","sourceId":"V0160","category":"vocab","year":92,"exam":"學測","stem":"The 70-year-old professor sued the university for age _____, because his teaching contract had not been renewed.","translation":"這位 70 歲的教授因教學合約未獲續聘，控告學校年齡歧視。","options":{"A":"possession","B":"commitment","C":"discrimination","D":"employment"},"answer":"C","explanation":"sued the university for age ___；age／racial discrimination（年齡／種族歧視）｜n. 歧視, 差別待遇","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0161","sourceId":"V0161","category":"vocab","year":92,"exam":"學測","stem":"Kevin burst into tears _____ because his teacher punished him in front of the whole class.","translation":"凱文當場就哭了出來，因為老師在全班面前處罰他。","options":{"A":"on the side","B":"on the spot","C":"on any account","D":"on the mark"},"answer":"B","explanation":"Kevin burst into tears ___；on the spot（當場、立刻，介系詞用 on 不用 at）｜片語 當場","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0162","sourceId":"V0162","category":"vocab","year":92,"exam":"學測","stem":"As soon as the couple realized that they didn’t love each other anymore, they _____.","translation":"這對情侶一發現彼此已不再相愛，便分手了。","options":{"A":"fell off","B":"cut in","C":"broke up","D":"stood by"},"answer":"C","explanation":"they didn’t love each other anymore, they ___；break up with sb（分手，講到分手的對象時介系詞要加 with）｜片語 分手, 解散","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0163","sourceId":"V0163","category":"vocab","year":92,"exam":"學測","stem":"The power workers had to work _____ to repair the power lines since the whole city was in the dark.","translation":"由於全市陷入停電，電力工人必須日夜不停地搶修電線。","options":{"A":"around the clock","B":"in the extreme","C":"on the house","D":"in the majority"},"answer":"A","explanation":"had to work ___ to repair the power lines；work around the clock（日夜不停，當形容詞時寫成 round-the-clock）｜片語 全天候, 不分晝夜","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0164","sourceId":"V0164","category":"vocab","year":92,"exam":"學測","stem":"After retirement, Mr. Wang _____ ice skating, which he had always loved but had not had time for.","translation":"退休後，王先生開始熱衷於溜冰，這是他一直喜愛卻始終沒時間從事的活動。","options":{"A":"appealed to","B":"took to","C":"related to","D":"saw to"},"answer":"B","explanation":"Mr. Wang ___ ice skating；take to + V-ing（喜歡上、開始迷上）｜片語 開始喜歡, 開始從事","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0165","sourceId":"V0165","category":"vocab","year":92,"exam":"學測","stem":"Why do we have to _____ Sue’s selfish behavior? We have to teach her to care for others.","translation":"我們為什麼要容忍蘇自私的行為？我們得教她多關心別人。","options":{"A":"get over with","B":"hang out with","C":"make up with","D":"put up with"},"answer":"D","explanation":"___ Sue’s selfish behavior；put up with + N（忍受…）｜片語 忍受","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0181","sourceId":"V0181","category":"vocab","year":93,"exam":"學測","stem":"I called the airline to ______ my flight reservation a week before I left for Canada.","translation":"我在前往加拿大的一週前，打電話給航空公司確認我的機票訂位。","options":{"A":"expand","B":"attach","C":"confirm","D":"strengthen"},"answer":"C","explanation":"｜v. 確認, 證實","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0182","sourceId":"V0182","category":"vocab","year":93,"exam":"學測","stem":"In order to write a report on stars, we decided to ______ the stars in the sky every night.","translation":"為了寫一篇關於星星的報告，我們決定每晚觀察天上的星星。","options":{"A":"design","B":"seize","C":"quote","D":"observe"},"answer":"D","explanation":"we decided to ___ the stars in the sky；observe + N（觀察，另有兩個搭配，observe the rules 遵守規則、observe a holiday 過節，都直接接受詞）｜v. 觀察, 注意到","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0183","sourceId":"V0183","category":"vocab","year":93,"exam":"學測","stem":"Julie wants to buy a ______ computer so that she can carry it around when she travels.","translation":"茱莉想買一台可攜式電腦，這樣她旅行時就能隨身攜帶。","options":{"A":"memorable","B":"portable","C":"predictable","D":"readable"},"answer":"B","explanation":"Julie wants to buy a ___ computer；a portable computer／radio／charger（可攜式的、手提的，中文的「攜帶」會讓人只想到 carry，形容詞要用 portable）｜adj. 可攜帶的, 可搬運的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0184","sourceId":"V0184","category":"vocab","year":93,"exam":"學測","stem":"My grandmother likes to surprise people. She never calls ______ to inform us of her visits.","translation":"我奶奶喜歡給人驚喜，她從不事先打電話通知我們她要來訪。","options":{"A":"beforehand","B":"anyhow","C":"originally","D":"consequently"},"answer":"A","explanation":"｜adv. 事先, 預先","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0185","sourceId":"V0185","category":"vocab","year":93,"exam":"學測","stem":"As the tallest building in the world, Taipei 101 has become a new ______ of Taipei City.","translation":"身為世界最高的建築，台北 101 已成為台北市的新地標。","options":{"A":"incident","B":"geography","C":"skylight","D":"landmark"},"answer":"D","explanation":"has become a new ___ of Taipei City；a landmark of + 地方（…的地標，用 of 不用 in，另有 a landmark decision 是劃時代的決定）｜n. 地標, 標誌性建築","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0186","sourceId":"V0186","category":"vocab","year":93,"exam":"學測","stem":"Many scholars and experts from all over the world will be invited to attend this yearly ______ on drug control.","translation":"世界各地許多學者專家將受邀出席這場關於毒品管制的年度會議。","options":{"A":"reference","B":"intention","C":"conference","D":"interaction"},"answer":"C","explanation":"this yearly ___ on drug control；a conference on + 主題（關於…的會議，主題用 on 不用 about）｜n. 會議, 研討會","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0187","sourceId":"V0187","category":"vocab","year":93,"exam":"學測","stem":"John had failed to pay his phone bills for months, so his telephone was ______ last week.","translation":"約翰好幾個月沒繳電話費，所以他的電話上週被停話了。","options":{"A":"interrupted","B":"disconnected","C":"excluded","D":"discriminated"},"answer":"B","explanation":"his telephone was ___ last week；disconnect the phone／the power（停話、斷電，指切斷線路或供應）｜v. 切斷, 停止供應","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0188","sourceId":"V0188","category":"vocab","year":93,"exam":"學測","stem":"The organic food products are made of natural ingredients, with no ______ flavors added.","translation":"這些有機食品是用天然原料製成的，沒有添加任何人工香料。","options":{"A":"accurate","B":"regular","C":"superficial","D":"artificial"},"answer":"D","explanation":"with no ___ flavors added；artificial flavors／colors（人工香料、人工色素，食品標示上習慣用複數）｜adj. 人工的, 人造的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0189","sourceId":"V0189","category":"vocab","year":93,"exam":"學測","stem":"Jessica is a very religious girl; she believes that she is always ______ supported by her god.","translation":"潔西卡是個非常虔誠的女孩；她相信自己在心靈上總是受到神的支持。","options":{"A":"spiritually","B":"typically","C":"historically","D":"officially"},"answer":"A","explanation":"｜adv. 精神上, 心靈上","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0190","sourceId":"V0190","category":"vocab","year":93,"exam":"學測","stem":"Jane usually buys things on ______. Her purchases seem to be driven by some sudden force or desire.","translation":"珍通常都是一時衝動購物，她的購買行為似乎是受某種突然的衝動驅使。","options":{"A":"accident","B":"compliment","C":"justification","D":"impulse"},"answer":"D","explanation":"Jane usually buys things on ___；buy sth on impulse（一時衝動買東西，impulse 這個意思固定配 on）｜n. 衝動, 一時的念頭","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0191","sourceId":"V0191","category":"vocab","year":93,"exam":"學測","stem":"The week-long rainfall has ______ landslides and flooding in the mountain areas.","translation":"長達一週的降雨已在山區引發了土石流與淹水。","options":{"A":"set about","B":"brought about","C":"come about","D":"put about"},"answer":"B","explanation":"has ___ landslides and flooding；bring about change／damage／landslides（造成、導致，接的是變化或災害這一類的結果）｜片語 造成, 引起","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0192","sourceId":"V0192","category":"vocab","year":93,"exam":"學測","stem":"In the cross-lake swimming race, a boat will be _____ in case of an emergency.","translation":"在橫渡湖泊的游泳比賽中，將有一艘船隨時待命，以防發生緊急狀況。","options":{"A":"standing by","B":"turning on","C":"getting on","D":"running down"},"answer":"A","explanation":"｜片語 待命, 做好準備","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0193","sourceId":"V0193","category":"vocab","year":93,"exam":"學測","stem":"The ground is slippery. Hold onto the rope and don’t ______.","translation":"地面很滑，抓緊繩子，不要放手。","options":{"A":"put off","B":"turn up","C":"let go","D":"take apart"},"answer":"C","explanation":"Hold onto the rope and don’t ___；let go of + N（放開…）｜片語 放手, 釋放","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0194","sourceId":"V0194","category":"vocab","year":93,"exam":"學測","stem":"______ the weather, the athletic meetings will be held on time.","translation":"不論天氣如何，運動會都將如期舉行。","options":{"A":"Instead of","B":"In relation to","C":"On behalf of","D":"Regardless of"},"answer":"D","explanation":"___ the weather, the athletic meetings will be held on time；regardless of + N（不論…，後面接名詞）｜片語 不論, 不顧","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0195","sourceId":"V0195","category":"vocab","year":93,"exam":"學測","stem":"If people keep polluting the rivers, no fish there will survive ______.","translation":"如果人們持續污染河川，長遠來看那裡的魚都無法存活。","options":{"A":"at all cost","B":"for a long while","C":"in the long run","D":"by no means"},"answer":"C","explanation":"｜片語 長遠來看","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0196","sourceId":"V0196","category":"vocab","year":94,"exam":"學測","stem":"As computers are getting less expensive, they are _______ used in schools and offices today.","translation":"隨著電腦價格越來越便宜，如今學校和辦公室都廣泛使用電腦。","options":{"A":"widely","B":"expectedly","C":"consciously","D":"influentially"},"answer":"A","explanation":"they are ___ used in schools and offices；be widely used／known／accepted（廣泛地被使用／被知道／被接受，widely 慣常搭配過去分詞）｜adv. 廣泛地","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0197","sourceId":"V0197","category":"vocab","year":94,"exam":"學測","stem":"Mr. Chang always tries to answer all questions from his students. He will not _____ any of them even if they may sound stupid.","translation":"張老師總是盡力回答學生所有的問題，即使問題聽起來很蠢，他也不會忽視。","options":{"A":"reform","B":"depress","C":"ignore","D":"confirm"},"answer":"C","explanation":"｜v. 忽視, 不理睬","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0198","sourceId":"V0198","category":"vocab","year":94,"exam":"學測","stem":"Irene does not throw away used envelopes. She ____ them by using them for taking telephone messages.","translation":"艾琳不會丟棄用過的信封，她會回收利用來記錄電話留言。","options":{"A":"designs","B":"recycles","C":"disguises","D":"manufactures"},"answer":"B","explanation":"｜v. 回收利用, 再利用","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0199","sourceId":"V0199","category":"vocab","year":94,"exam":"學測","stem":"Cheese, powdered milk, and yogurt are common milk ____.","translation":"起司、奶粉和優格都是常見的乳製品。","options":{"A":"produces","B":"products","C":"productions","D":"productivities"},"answer":"B","explanation":"are common milk ___；milk／dairy／agricultural products（乳製品／農產品，前面直接擺名詞當修飾語，不用 of）｜n. 產品, 製品","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0200","sourceId":"V0200","category":"vocab","year":94,"exam":"學測","stem":"Although he is a chef, Roberto _____ cooks his own meals.","translation":"雖然羅伯托是一名廚師，但他很少自己下廚做飯。","options":{"A":"rarely","B":"bitterly","C":"naturally","D":"skillfully"},"answer":"A","explanation":"｜adv. 很少地, 罕有地","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0201","sourceId":"V0201","category":"vocab","year":94,"exam":"學測","stem":"Due to the yearly bonus system, the 100 ________ positions in this high-tech company have attracted many applicants from around the island.","translation":"由於年終獎金制度，這家高科技公司的 100 個職缺吸引了全島各地許多應徵者。","options":{"A":"loyal","B":"evident","C":"typical","D":"vacant"},"answer":"D","explanation":"the 100 ___ positions；a vacant position／seat（沒人占用的職位／座位，empty 講的是容器裡面空的）｜adj. 空的, 空缺的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0202","sourceId":"V0202","category":"vocab","year":94,"exam":"學測","stem":"If you want to borrow magazines, tapes, or CDs, you can visit the library. They are all ______ there.","translation":"如果你想借雜誌、錄音帶或光碟，可以去圖書館，那裡都有。","options":{"A":"sufficient","B":"marvelous","C":"impressive","D":"available"},"answer":"D","explanation":"They are all ___ there；be available to + 人／available for + 用途（開放給某人／供某用途使用）｜adj. 可獲得的, 有空的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0203","sourceId":"V0203","category":"vocab","year":94,"exam":"學測","stem":"The fire in the fireworks factory in Changhua set off a series of powerful  _________ and killed four people.","translation":"彰化一間煙火工廠發生火災，引發一連串猛烈爆炸，造成四人死亡。","options":{"A":"explosions","B":"extensions","C":"inspections","D":"impressions"},"answer":"A","explanation":"set off a series of powerful ___；set off／cause an explosion（引發爆炸，中文說「引發」而英文不用 make）｜n. 爆炸, 爆發","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0204","sourceId":"V0204","category":"vocab","year":94,"exam":"學測","stem":"A good government official has to ________ the temptation of money and make the right decision.","translation":"一位優秀的政府官員必須抵抗金錢的誘惑，做出正確的決定。","options":{"A":"consist","B":"insist","C":"resist","D":"persist"},"answer":"C","explanation":"___ the temptation of money；resist temptation（抵擋誘惑）｜v. 抵抗, 抗拒","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0205","sourceId":"V0205","category":"vocab","year":94,"exam":"學測","stem":"The drug dealer was ________ by the police while he was selling cocaine to a high school student.","translation":"這名毒販在向一名高中生販賣古柯鹼時被警方逮捕。","options":{"A":"threatened","B":"endangered","C":"demonstrated","D":"arrested"},"answer":"D","explanation":"The drug dealer was ___ by the police；be arrested for + 罪名（因某罪名被逮捕，by 後面帶的是執法的一方）｜v. 逮捕, 拘留","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0206","sourceId":"V0206","category":"vocab","year":94,"exam":"學測","stem":"The rise of oil prices made scientists search for new energy resources to ______ oil.","translation":"油價上漲促使科學家尋找能取代石油的新能源。","options":{"A":"apply","B":"replace","C":"inform","D":"persuade"},"answer":"B","explanation":"new energy resources to ___ oil；replace A with B（用 B 取代 A，中文先講 B，英文的受詞卻是被換掉的 A。substitute 剛好相反：substitute B for A 才是用 B 代替 A。replace A as B 這個用法見 102 年學測第 2 題）｜v. 取代, 代替","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0207","sourceId":"V0207","category":"vocab","year":94,"exam":"學測","stem":"Without much contact with the outside world for many years, John found many technological inventions _____ to him.","translation":"多年來與外界甚少接觸，約翰發現許多科技發明對他來說都很陌生。","options":{"A":"natural","B":"common","C":"foreign","D":"objective"},"answer":"C","explanation":"found many technological inventions ___ to him；be foreign to sb（對某人來說很陌生、格格不入，介系詞用 to）｜adj. 外國的, 陌生的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0208","sourceId":"V0208","category":"vocab","year":94,"exam":"學測","stem":"The medicine you take for a cold may cause _____; try not to drive after you take it.","translation":"你吃的感冒藥可能會導致嗜睡，服用後盡量避免開車。","options":{"A":"incident","B":"violence","C":"bacteria","D":"drowsiness"},"answer":"D","explanation":"The medicine you take for a cold may cause ___；cause／induce drowsiness（造成／引發睡意，中文的「造成」不用 make，同組的副作用名詞還有 dizziness 頭暈、nausea 噁心）｜n. 睡意, 嗜睡","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0209","sourceId":"V0209","category":"vocab","year":94,"exam":"學測","stem":"To gain more ______, some legislators would get into violent physical fights so that they may appear in TV news reports.","translation":"為了獲得更多曝光度，有些立委會做出激烈的肢體衝突，好讓自己出現在電視新聞報導中。","options":{"A":"publicity","B":"reputation","C":"significance","D":"communication"},"answer":"A","explanation":"To gain more ___；gain publicity（獲得曝光）｜n. 宣傳, 關注","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0210","sourceId":"V0210","category":"vocab","year":94,"exam":"學測","stem":"To live an efficient life, we have to arrange the things to do in order of _____ and start with the most important ones.","translation":"為了有效率地生活，我們必須依優先順序安排要做的事，先從最重要的開始。","options":{"A":"authority","B":"priority","C":"regularity","D":"security"},"answer":"B","explanation":"arrange the things to do in order of ___；give priority to + N（把…列為優先處理，介系詞用 to）｜n. 優先事項, 優先順序","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0211","sourceId":"V0211","category":"vocab","year":95,"exam":"學測","stem":"If we can ______ to, we will take a vacation abroad in the summer.","translation":"如果經濟能力許可，我們夏天會出國度假。","options":{"A":"pay","B":"move","C":"expose","D":"afford"},"answer":"D","explanation":"If we can ___ to, we will take a vacation abroad；can／can't afford + N／to V（買得起，幾乎只出現在 can、could、be able to 之後）｜vt. 買得起, 負擔得起","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0212","sourceId":"V0212","category":"vocab","year":95,"exam":"學測","stem":"A ______ mistake found in parenthood is that parents often set unrealistic goals for their children.","translation":"為人父母常犯的一個錯誤，就是常為孩子設定不切實際的目標。","options":{"A":"terrific","B":"common","C":"straight","D":"favorable"},"answer":"B","explanation":"A ___ mistake found in parenthood；a common mistake／common sense／common ground（常犯的錯誤／常識／共同點，形容詞用 common，不用 usual 或 often）｜adj. 常見的, 普遍的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0213","sourceId":"V0213","category":"vocab","year":95,"exam":"學測","stem":"Some words, such as “sandwich” and “hamburger,” were ______ the names of people or even towns.","translation":"有些字，像是「三明治」和「漢堡」，原本是人名，甚至是城鎮的名字。","options":{"A":"originally","B":"ideally","C":"relatively","D":"sincerely"},"answer":"A","explanation":"｜adv. 原本, 本來","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0214","sourceId":"V0214","category":"vocab","year":95,"exam":"學測","stem":"Have you ever ______ how the ancient Egyptians created such marvelous feats of engineering as the pyramids?","translation":"你是否曾經好奇，古埃及人是如何創造出金字塔這樣驚人的工程壯舉？","options":{"A":"concluded","B":"wondered","C":"admitted","D":"persuaded"},"answer":"B","explanation":"Have you ever ___ how the ancient Egyptians created；wonder how／why／if + 子句（好奇、想知道，後面直接接子句，不加 about）｜v. 想知道, 好奇","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0215","sourceId":"V0215","category":"vocab","year":95,"exam":"學測","stem":"Mr. Johnson was disappointed at his students for having a passive learning ______.","translation":"強森老師對學生消極被動的學習態度感到失望。","options":{"A":"result","B":"progress","C":"attitude","D":"energy"},"answer":"C","explanation":"for having a passive learning ___；one's attitude toward／to + N（對某事的態度，用 toward 或 to，不用 for）｜n. 態度, 看法","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0216","sourceId":"V0216","category":"vocab","year":95,"exam":"學測","stem":"Anne dreaded giving a speech before three hundred people; even thinking about it made her ______.","translation":"安很害怕在三百人面前演講；光是想到這件事就讓她感到焦慮。","options":{"A":"passionate","B":"anxious","C":"ambitious","D":"optimistic"},"answer":"B","explanation":"even thinking about it made her ___；be anxious about + N／be anxious to + V（前者是擔心某事，後者是急著想做某事）；anxious parents／patients／contestants、an anxious wait（焦急的父母／病人／參賽者、焦慮的等待，放在名詞前面）｜adj. 焦慮的, 不安的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0217","sourceId":"V0217","category":"vocab","year":95,"exam":"學測","stem":"I had to ______ Jack’s invitation to the party because it conflicted with an important business meeting.","translation":"我不得不婉拒傑克的派對邀請，因為時間和一場重要的商務會議衝突。","options":{"A":"decline","B":"depart","C":"devote","D":"deserve"},"answer":"A","explanation":"I had to ___ Jack’s invitation to the party；decline an invitation／an offer／a request（婉拒邀請、提議、請求）｜v. 婉拒, 謝絕","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0218","sourceId":"V0218","category":"vocab","year":95,"exam":"學測","stem":"Selling fried chicken at the night market doesn’t seem to be a decent business, but it is actually quite ______.","translation":"在夜市賣炸雞看似不是什麼體面的生意，但其實相當賺錢。","options":{"A":"plentiful","B":"precious","C":"profitable","D":"productive"},"answer":"C","explanation":"but it is actually quite ___；a profitable business／venture／investment（賺錢的生意／事業／投資）｜adj. 賺錢的, 有利潤的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0219","sourceId":"V0219","category":"vocab","year":95,"exam":"學測","stem":"The passengers ______ escaped death when a bomb exploded in the subway station, killing sixty people.","translation":"一顆炸彈在地鐵站爆炸，造成 60 人死亡，這些乘客僥倖逃過一劫。","options":{"A":"traditionally","B":"valuably","C":"loosely","D":"narrowly"},"answer":"D","explanation":"The passengers ___ escaped death；narrowly escape death／injury／defeat（差一點就沒命／受傷／落敗）｜adv. 勉強地, 差一點","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0220","sourceId":"V0220","category":"vocab","year":95,"exam":"學測","stem":"Jerry didn’t ______ his primary school classmate Mary until he listened to her self-introduction.","translation":"傑瑞直到聽了瑪麗的自我介紹後，才認出她是自己的小學同學。","options":{"A":"acquaint","B":"acquire","C":"recognize","D":"realize"},"answer":"C","explanation":"Jerry didn’t ___ his primary school classmate Mary；can hardly recognize sb／recognize A as B（幾乎認不出某人／認出 A 是 B）｜vt. 認出, 認可","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0221","sourceId":"V0221","category":"vocab","year":95,"exam":"學測","stem":"With the completion of several public ______ projects, such as the MRT, commuting to work has become easier for people living in the suburbs.","translation":"隨著捷運等多項公共運輸建設完工，郊區居民通勤上班變得更加便利。","options":{"A":"transportation","B":"traffic","C":"travel","D":"transfer"},"answer":"A","explanation":"several public ___ projects, such as the MRT；public transportation／means of transportation（大眾運輸／交通工具，車流量才是 traffic）｜n. 運輸, 交通運輸","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0222","sourceId":"V0222","category":"vocab","year":95,"exam":"學測","stem":"With a good ______ of both Chinese and English, Miss Lin was assigned the task of oral interpretation for the visiting American delegation.","translation":"由於精通中英雙語，林小姐被指派為來訪美國代表團擔任口譯工作。","options":{"A":"writing","B":"program","C":"command","D":"impression"},"answer":"C","explanation":"a good ___ of both Chinese and English；have a good command of + 語言（精通某語言）｜n. 掌握, 運用能力","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0223","sourceId":"V0223","category":"vocab","year":95,"exam":"學測","stem":"I am studying so hard for the forthcoming entrance exam that I do not have the ______ of a free weekend to rest.","translation":"我正為即將到來的入學考試拚命讀書，根本沒有奢侈的空閒週末可以休息。","options":{"A":"luxury","B":"license","C":"limitation","D":"strength"},"answer":"A","explanation":"I do not have the ___ of a free weekend；have the luxury of + N／V-ing（奢侈到還有餘裕做某事）｜n. 奢侈, 豪華","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0224","sourceId":"V0224","category":"vocab","year":95,"exam":"學測","stem":"Kim was completely ______ after jogging in the hot sun all afternoon; she had little energy left.","translation":"金在烈日下慢跑了一整個下午後，整個人筋疲力盡，幾乎沒有力氣了。","options":{"A":"kicked out","B":"handed out","C":"worn out","D":"put out"},"answer":"C","explanation":"｜片語 筋疲力盡的, 疲憊不堪的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0225","sourceId":"V0225","category":"vocab","year":95,"exam":"學測","stem":"When Jason failed to pay his bill, the network company ______ his Internet connection.","translation":"傑森未繳費，網路公司便切斷了他的網路連線。","options":{"A":"cut off","B":"cut back","C":"cut short","D":"cut down"},"answer":"A","explanation":"the network company ___ his Internet connection；cut off the power／the water／the Internet connection（切斷電力／自來水／網路連線）｜片語 切斷, 中斷","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0226","sourceId":"V0226","category":"vocab","year":96,"exam":"學測","stem":"The movie director adapted this year’s bestseller into a hit and made a ______.","translation":"這位電影導演把今年的暢銷書改編成賣座電影，賺進了一大筆財富。","options":{"A":"fortune","B":"request","C":"companion","D":"decision"},"answer":"A","explanation":"made a ___；make a fortune（賺大錢）｜n. 財富, 一大筆錢","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0227","sourceId":"V0227","category":"vocab","year":96,"exam":"學測","stem":"Wang Chien-ming, the Yankees’ best pitcher last year, already showed his great _____ for baseball when he was still a teenager.","translation":"王建民——去年洋基隊最出色的投手——早在青少年時期就已展現出他在棒球方面的過人潛力。","options":{"A":"response","B":"reluctance","C":"permission","D":"potential"},"answer":"D","explanation":"already showed his great ___ for baseball；show／have great potential for + N（展現在某方面的潛力，用 for 不用 of）｜n. 潛力, 潛能","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0228","sourceId":"V0228","category":"vocab","year":96,"exam":"學測","stem":"Although Jeffery had to keep two part-time jobs to support his family, he never ______ his studies. In fact, he graduated with honors.","translation":"儘管傑弗瑞得同時打兩份工來養家，他從未忽略自己的學業，事實上他還以優異成績畢業。","options":{"A":"neglected","B":"segmented","C":"financed","D":"diminished"},"answer":"A","explanation":"he never ___ his studies；neglect one's studies／duty／health（疏忽學業、職責、健康，直接接受詞）｜v. 忽略, 忽視","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0229","sourceId":"V0229","category":"vocab","year":96,"exam":"學測","stem":"If it is too cold in this room, you can ______ the air conditioner to make yourself feel comfortable.","translation":"如果這個房間太冷，你可以調整空調讓自己感覺舒適一點。","options":{"A":"fasten","B":"adjust","C":"defeat","D":"upload"},"answer":"B","explanation":"you can ___ the air conditioner；adjust + N／adjust to + N（前者是調整某物，後者是適應新環境）｜v. 調整, 適應","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0230","sourceId":"V0230","category":"vocab","year":96,"exam":"學測","stem":"This course will provide students with a solid ______ for research. It is highly recommended for those who plan to go to graduate school.","translation":"這門課將為學生打下紮實的研究基礎，非常推薦給打算讀研究所的人。","options":{"A":"admission","B":"circulation","C":"foundation","D":"extension"},"answer":"C","explanation":"provide students with a solid ___ for research；lay／provide a solid foundation for + N（為某事打下紮實的基礎）｜n. 基礎, 根據","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0231","sourceId":"V0231","category":"vocab","year":96,"exam":"學測","stem":"Peter is now living on a ______ of NT$100 per day. He cannot afford any recreational activities.","translation":"彼得現在每天靠新台幣 100 元的預算過活，負擔不起任何休閒活動。","options":{"A":"division","B":"guidance","C":"measure","D":"budget"},"answer":"D","explanation":"Peter is now living on a ___ of NT$100 per day；live on a tight／limited budget（靠有限的預算過活，用 on 不用 with）｜n. 預算","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0232","sourceId":"V0232","category":"vocab","year":96,"exam":"學測","stem":"Amy succeeded in ______ for a raise though her boss didn’t agree to increase her salary at first.","translation":"儘管老闆一開始不同意加薪，艾咪最終還是協商成功爭取到加薪。","options":{"A":"compensating","B":"negotiating","C":"substituting","D":"advertising"},"answer":"B","explanation":"succeeded in ___ for a raise；succeed in + V-ing（成功做到…）｜v. 協商, 談判","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0233","sourceId":"V0233","category":"vocab","year":96,"exam":"學測","stem":"Ms. Li’s business ______ very quickly. She opened her first store two years ago; now she has fifty stores all over the country.","translation":"李小姐的事業擴張得很快，她兩年前開了第一間店，如今全國已有五十家分店。","options":{"A":"discouraged","B":"transferred","C":"stretched","D":"expanded"},"answer":"D","explanation":"｜v. 擴大, 擴張","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0234","sourceId":"V0234","category":"vocab","year":96,"exam":"學測","stem":"Ruth is a very ____ person. She cannot take any criticism and always finds excuses to justify herself.","translation":"露絲是個防衛心很重的人，她無法接受任何批評，總是為自己找藉口辯解。","options":{"A":"shameful","B":"innocent","C":"defensive","D":"outgoing"},"answer":"C","explanation":"a very ___ person；be defensive about + N（對…聽不得批評）｜adj. 防衛的, 懷有戒心的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0235","sourceId":"V0235","category":"vocab","year":96,"exam":"學測","stem":"It’s a pity that you have to leave so soon. I ______ hope that you will come back very soon.","translation":"你這麼快就得離開真是可惜，我誠心希望你能盡快再回來。","options":{"A":"sincerely","B":"scarcely","C":"reliably","D":"obviously"},"answer":"A","explanation":"I ___ hope that you will come back very soon；sincerely hope／apologize／regret（誠心希望、鄭重道歉、深感遺憾，後面接的是表達心意的動詞）｜adv. 真誠地","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0236","sourceId":"V0236","category":"vocab","year":96,"exam":"學測","stem":"We human beings may live without clothes, but food and air are ______ to our life.","translation":"人類或許可以沒有衣服生活，但食物和空氣對我們的生命是不可或缺的。","options":{"A":"magnificent","B":"essential","C":"influential","D":"profitable"},"answer":"B","explanation":"food and air are ___ to our life；be essential to／for + N（對某人某事不可或缺）｜adj. 必要的, 不可或缺的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0237","sourceId":"V0237","category":"vocab","year":96,"exam":"學測","stem":"The manager ______ without hesitation after he had been offered a better job in another company.","translation":"這位經理在獲得另一家公司更好的工作機會後，毫不猶豫地辭職了。","options":{"A":"retreated","B":"revived","C":"removed","D":"resigned"},"answer":"D","explanation":"The manager ___ without hesitation；resign from + N（辭去…職務）｜v. 辭職, 辭去","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0238","sourceId":"V0238","category":"vocab","year":96,"exam":"學測","stem":"Many important legal ______ concerning the tragic incident have now been preserved in the museum.","translation":"許多與這起悲劇事件相關的重要法律文件，如今都保存在博物館裡。","options":{"A":"distributions","B":"formations","C":"documents","D":"constructions"},"answer":"C","explanation":"legal ___ concerning the incident；a legal document（法律文件，不是 law document）｜n. 文件","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0239","sourceId":"V0239","category":"vocab","year":96,"exam":"學測","stem":"I’m not sure exactly how much scholarship you’ll receive, but it will _____ cover your major expenses.","translation":"我不確定你能拿到多少獎學金，但大致上應該足以支付你的主要開銷。","options":{"A":"recently","B":"roughly","C":"frankly","D":"variously"},"answer":"B","explanation":"it will ___ cover your major expenses；a rough estimate（粗估）｜adv. 大約, 大致上","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0240","sourceId":"V0240","category":"vocab","year":96,"exam":"學測","stem":"Tom was very ill a week ago, but now he looks healthy. We are ______ by his quick recovery.","translation":"湯姆一週前病得很重，但現在看起來很健康，我們都對他快速的復原感到驚訝。","options":{"A":"amazed","B":"convinced","C":"advised","D":"confirmed"},"answer":"A","explanation":"We are ___ by his quick recovery；be amazed by／at + N／be amazed to + V（對某事感到驚訝）｜adj. 驚訝的；v. 使驚訝","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0241","sourceId":"V0241","category":"vocab","year":97,"exam":"學測","stem":"Amy did not _____ changes in the course schedule and therefore missed the class.","translation":"艾咪沒注意到課表的變動，因此錯過了那堂課。","options":{"A":"arrest","B":"alarm","C":"notice","D":"delay"},"answer":"C","explanation":"｜vt. 注意到, 察覺","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0242","sourceId":"V0242","category":"vocab","year":97,"exam":"學測","stem":"It is not easy for old people to _____ their backs, so they need help when their backs itch.","translation":"老年人要抓自己的背並不容易，所以背癢時需要別人幫忙。","options":{"A":"label","B":"scratch","C":"lighten","D":"squeeze"},"answer":"B","explanation":"for old people to ___ their backs；scratch one's back／head／an itch（用指甲抓。另有 scratch the surface，指只碰到表面、沒真正深入）｜v. 抓, 搔","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0243","sourceId":"V0243","category":"vocab","year":97,"exam":"學測","stem":"Mary is suffering from a stomachache and needs to eat food which is easy to _____.","translation":"瑪麗胃痛，需要吃容易消化的食物。","options":{"A":"launch","B":"invade","C":"adopt","D":"digest"},"answer":"D","explanation":"food which is easy to ___；digest food／a meal（把食物消化掉。也用在資訊上，digest information 指把大量資料看懂、吸收進去）｜v. 消化, 理解","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0244","sourceId":"V0244","category":"vocab","year":97,"exam":"學測","stem":"Since our classroom is not air-conditioned, we have to _____ the heat during the hot summer days.","translation":"由於教室沒有冷氣，炎熱的夏天我們只能忍受高溫。","options":{"A":"consume","B":"tolerate","C":"recover","D":"promote"},"answer":"B","explanation":"we have to ___ the heat；tolerate the heat／the noise／the pain／different opinions（撐得住撐不住的事用它，容忍不同意見也用它）｜v. 容忍, 忍受","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0245","sourceId":"V0245","category":"vocab","year":97,"exam":"學測","stem":"Sue is so _____ that she always breaks something when she is shopping at a store.","translation":"蘇很笨拙，每次在店裡購物總會弄壞什麼東西。","options":{"A":"religious","B":"visual","C":"clumsy","D":"intimate"},"answer":"C","explanation":"｜adj. 笨拙的, 笨手笨腳的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0246","sourceId":"V0246","category":"vocab","year":97,"exam":"學測","stem":"Ann enjoyed going to the flower market. She believed that the _____ of flowers refreshed her mind.","translation":"安很喜歡逛花市，她相信花朵的香氣能讓她神清氣爽。","options":{"A":"instance","B":"dominance","C":"appliance","D":"fragrance"},"answer":"D","explanation":"the ___ of flowers refreshed her mind；the fragrance of flowers／a sweet fragrance（花香。芳香療法的英文是 aromatherapy，不是 fragrance therapy）｜n. 芬芳, 香味","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0247","sourceId":"V0247","category":"vocab","year":97,"exam":"學測","stem":"The profits of Prince Charles’s organic farm go to _____ to help the poor and the sick.","translation":"查爾斯王子有機農場的利潤都捐給慈善機構，幫助貧困與病患。","options":{"A":"charities","B":"bulletins","C":"harvests","D":"rebels"},"answer":"A","explanation":"organic farm go to ___；donate／give to charity（捐錢做善事時 charity 不加冠詞也不加 s。加了 s 的 charities 指的是一個個慈善團體）｜n. 慈善機構, 慈善事業","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0248","sourceId":"V0248","category":"vocab","year":97,"exam":"學測","stem":"Jack was given the rare _____ of using the president’s office, which made others quite jealous.","translation":"傑克獲得使用總裁辦公室這項難得的特權，讓其他人相當眼紅。","options":{"A":"mischief","B":"privilege","C":"involvement","D":"occupation"},"answer":"B","explanation":"was given the rare ___ of using；be given／enjoy the privilege of + V-ing（後面接 of 加動名詞，不接不定詞）｜n. 特權, 榮幸","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0249","sourceId":"V0249","category":"vocab","year":97,"exam":"學測","stem":"This new computer is obviously _____ to the old one because it has many new functions.","translation":"這台新電腦明顯優於舊電腦，因為它有許多新功能。","options":{"A":"technical","B":"suitable","C":"superior","D":"typical"},"answer":"C","explanation":"is obviously ___ to the old one；be superior／inferior／senior／junior／prior to（這一組從拉丁文來的比較詞後面一律接 to，不接 than）｜adj. 較好的, 優越的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0250","sourceId":"V0250","category":"vocab","year":97,"exam":"學測","stem":"Simon loves his work. To him, work always comes first, and family and friends are _____.","translation":"賽門熱愛他的工作。對他而言，工作永遠是第一位，家人與朋友都是其次。","options":{"A":"secondary","B":"temporary","C":"sociable","D":"capable"},"answer":"A","explanation":"family and friends are ___；be secondary to + N／of secondary importance（次要於某件事。secondary school 那個 secondary 是中等的，跟本題的次要不是同一個意思）｜adj. 次要的, 從屬的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0251","sourceId":"V0251","category":"vocab","year":97,"exam":"學測","stem":"Although your plans look good, you have to be _____ and consider what you can actually do.","translation":"雖然你的計畫看起來不錯，但你必須實際一點，考慮自己真正能做到的事。","options":{"A":"dramatic","B":"realistic","C":"stressful","D":"manageable"},"answer":"B","explanation":"you have to be ___；be realistic about + N／a realistic goal／plan／expectation（對某件事實際一點，介系詞用 about）｜adj. 實際的, 務實的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0252","sourceId":"V0252","category":"vocab","year":97,"exam":"學測","stem":"Built under the sea in 1994, the _____ between England and France connects the UK more closely with mainland Europe.","translation":"這條 1994 年建於海底的隧道，將英國與歐洲大陸連結得更緊密。","options":{"A":"waterfall","B":"temple","C":"tunnel","D":"channel"},"answer":"C","explanation":"｜n. 隧道, 地下道","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0253","sourceId":"V0253","category":"vocab","year":97,"exam":"學測","stem":"This tour package is very appealing, and that one looks _____ attractive. I don’t know which one to choose.","translation":"這個旅遊行程很吸引人，那個看起來也同樣誘人，我不知道該選哪一個。","options":{"A":"equally","B":"annually","C":"merely","D":"gratefully"},"answer":"A","explanation":"｜adv. 同樣地, 一樣地","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0254","sourceId":"V0254","category":"vocab","year":97,"exam":"學測","stem":"Hseu Fang-yi, a young Taiwanese dancer, recently _____ at Lincoln Center in New York and won a great deal of praise.","translation":"台灣年輕舞者許芳宜最近在紐約林肯中心演出，贏得了廣大讚譽。","options":{"A":"performed","B":"pretended","C":"postponed","D":"persuaded"},"answer":"A","explanation":"recently ___ at Lincoln Center；perform a play／a concert／an operation／a task（表演之外，動手術與執行任務也用 perform）｜v. 表演, 演出","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0255","sourceId":"V0255","category":"vocab","year":97,"exam":"學測","stem":"The police searched the house of the suspect _____. They almost turned the whole house upside down.","translation":"警方徹底搜查了嫌犯的住處，幾乎把整間屋子翻了個底朝天。","options":{"A":"relatively","B":"thoroughly","C":"casually","D":"permanently"},"answer":"B","explanation":"searched the house of the suspect ___；thoroughly inspect／investigate／examine／clean（配的是要做到毫無遺漏的那一類動作。另有 thoroughly enjoy，那個 thoroughly 是非常的意思）｜adv. 徹底地, 仔細地","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0256","sourceId":"V0256","category":"vocab","year":98,"exam":"學測","stem":"Steve’s description of the place was so _____ that I could almost picture it in my mind.","translation":"史提夫對那個地方的描述非常生動，讓我幾乎能在腦海中想像出畫面。","options":{"A":"bitter","B":"vivid","C":"sensitive","D":"courageous"},"answer":"B","explanation":"description of the place was so ___；a vivid description／imagination／memory／dream（想像力豐富是 vivid，不是 rich）｜adj. 生動的, 鮮明的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0257","sourceId":"V0257","category":"vocab","year":98,"exam":"學測","stem":"When people feel uncomfortable or nervous, they may _____ their arms across their chests as if to protect themselves.","translation":"當人們感到不自在或緊張時，可能會把雙臂交叉抱在胸前，彷彿在保護自己。","options":{"A":"toss","B":"fold","C":"veil","D":"yield"},"answer":"B","explanation":"they may ___ their arms across their chests；fold one's arms／with one's arms folded（抱胸。後者是 with + 受詞 + 受詞補語）｜v. 摺疊, 交叉（雙臂）","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0258","sourceId":"V0258","category":"vocab","year":98,"exam":"學測","stem":"The doors of these department stores slide open _____ when you approach them. You don’t have to open them yourself.","translation":"這些百貨公司的門在你靠近時會自動滑開，不需要自己動手開門。","options":{"A":"necessarily","B":"diligently","C":"automatically","D":"intentionally"},"answer":"C","explanation":"｜adv. 自動地, 不自覺地","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0259","sourceId":"V0259","category":"vocab","year":98,"exam":"學測","stem":"Nicole is a _____ language learner. Within a short period of time, she has developed a good command of Chinese and Japanese.","translation":"妮可是個出色的語言學習者，在短時間內就精通了中文與日文。","options":{"A":"convenient","B":"popular","C":"regular","D":"brilliant"},"answer":"D","explanation":"Nicole is a ___ language learner；a brilliant student／idea／performance（才華洋溢，不是明亮的那個意思）｜adj. 聰穎的, 出色的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0260","sourceId":"V0260","category":"vocab","year":98,"exam":"學測","stem":"With rising oil prices, there is an increasing _____ for people to ride bicycles to work.","translation":"隨著油價上漲，越來越多人傾向騎腳踏車上班。","options":{"A":"permit","B":"instrument","C":"appearance","D":"tendency"},"answer":"D","explanation":"there is an increasing ___ for people to ride bicycles；a tendency to + V／a tendency for sb to V（接不定詞，不接 of + V-ing）｜n. 傾向, 趨勢","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0261","sourceId":"V0261","category":"vocab","year":98,"exam":"學測","stem":"This information came from a very _____ source, so you don’t have to worry about being cheated.","translation":"這項資訊來自非常可靠的來源，所以你不必擔心被騙。","options":{"A":"reliable","B":"flexible","C":"clumsy","D":"brutal"},"answer":"A","explanation":"came from a very ___ source；a reliable source／partner／supplier（另有 according to reliable sources，用複數、不加冠詞）｜adj. 可靠的, 可信賴的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0262","sourceId":"V0262","category":"vocab","year":98,"exam":"學測","stem":"We hope that there will be no war in the world and that all people live in peace and _____ with each other.","translation":"我們希望世界上不再有戰爭，所有人都能和平和諧地相處。","options":{"A":"complaint","B":"harmony","C":"mission","D":"texture"},"answer":"B","explanation":"all people live in peace and ___ with each other；live／be in harmony with sb（和睦相處。介系詞固定用 with）｜n. 和諧, 協調","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0263","sourceId":"V0263","category":"vocab","year":98,"exam":"學測","stem":"To have a full discussion of the issue, the committee spent a whole hour _____ their ideas at the meeting.","translation":"為了充分討論這個議題，委員會在會議上花了整整一個小時交換意見。","options":{"A":"depositing","B":"exchanging","C":"governing","D":"interrupting"},"answer":"B","explanation":"spent a whole hour ___ their ideas at the meeting；exchange ideas／information／gifts／greetings（交換意見用 exchange，不用 change）｜v. 交換, 交流","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0264","sourceId":"V0264","category":"vocab","year":98,"exam":"學測","stem":"While adapting to western ways of living, many Asian immigrants in the US still try hard to _____ their own cultures and traditions.","translation":"許多在美國的亞裔移民，在適應西方生活方式的同時，仍努力保存自己的文化與傳統。","options":{"A":"volunteer","B":"scatter","C":"preserve","D":"motivate"},"answer":"C","explanation":"try hard to ___ their own cultures and traditions；preserve culture／tradition／wildlife／food（保存原樣。preserved fruit 是蜜餞，protect 是防止傷害）｜v. 保存, 保護","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0265","sourceId":"V0265","category":"vocab","year":98,"exam":"學測","stem":"With the worsening of global economic conditions, it seems wiser and more _____ to keep cash in the bank rather than to invest in the stock market.","translation":"隨著全球經濟狀況惡化，把現金存在銀行似乎比投資股市更明智、更理智。","options":{"A":"sensible","B":"portable","C":"explicit","D":"anxious"},"answer":"A","explanation":"seems wiser and more ___ to keep cash；a sensible decision／choice（明智的決定／選擇）｜adj. 明智的, 理智的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0266","sourceId":"V0266","category":"vocab","year":98,"exam":"學測","stem":"Under the _____ of newly elected president Barack Obama, the US is expected to turn a new page in politics and economy.","translation":"在新當選總統歐巴馬的領導下，美國預期將在政治與經濟上翻開新的一頁。","options":{"A":"adoption","B":"fragrance","C":"identity","D":"leadership"},"answer":"D","explanation":"Under the ___ of newly elected president；under the leadership of sb（在某人的領導下。介系詞是 under，不是 in）｜n. 領導, 領導能力","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0267","sourceId":"V0267","category":"vocab","year":98,"exam":"學測","stem":"Rapid advancement in motor engineering makes it _____ possible to build a flying car in the near future.","translation":"汽車工程的快速進步，使得在不久的將來打造飛天車在技術上成為可能。","options":{"A":"individually","B":"narrowly","C":"punctually","D":"technically"},"answer":"D","explanation":"makes it ___ possible to build a flying car；technically possible／feasible／illegal（另有 technically speaking，那個是嚴格說來）｜adv. 技術上, 嚴格說來","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0268","sourceId":"V0268","category":"vocab","year":98,"exam":"學測","stem":"When you take photos, you can move around to shoot the target object from different _____.","translation":"拍照時，你可以移動位置，從不同角度拍攝目標物。","options":{"A":"moods","B":"trends","C":"angles","D":"inputs"},"answer":"C","explanation":"shoot the target object from different ___；from a different angle／from different angles（介系詞是 from，不是 in）｜n. 角度, 觀點","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0269","sourceId":"V0269","category":"vocab","year":98,"exam":"學測","stem":"Students were asked to _____ or rewrite their compositions based on the teacher’s comments.","translation":"學生被要求根據老師的評語修改或重寫作文。","options":{"A":"revise","B":"resign","C":"refresh","D":"remind"},"answer":"A","explanation":"asked to ___ or rewrite their compositions；revise an essay（修改文章）｜v. 修改, 修訂","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0270","sourceId":"V0270","category":"vocab","year":98,"exam":"學測","stem":"Besides lung cancer, another _____ of smoking is wrinkles, a premature sign of aging.","translation":"除了肺癌之外，吸菸的另一個後果是皺紋，這是提早老化的徵兆。","options":{"A":"blessing","B":"campaign","C":"consequence","D":"breakthrough"},"answer":"C","explanation":"another ___ of smoking is wrinkles；a consequence of + N／suffer／face the consequences（承擔後果那一組固定用複數）｜n. 後果, 結果","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0271","sourceId":"V0271","category":"vocab","year":99,"exam":"學測","stem":"Mr. Lin is a very ________ writer; he publishes at least five novels every year.","translation":"林先生是位非常多產的作家，他每年至少出版五本小說。","options":{"A":"moderate","B":"temporary","C":"productive","D":"reluctant"},"answer":"C","explanation":"Mr. Lin is a very ___ writer；a productive writer／meeting／discussion（多產的。用在會議討論是有成效的）｜adj. 多產的, 富有成效的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0272","sourceId":"V0272","category":"vocab","year":99,"exam":"學測","stem":"Using a heating pad or taking warm baths can sometimes help to _____ pain in the lower back.","translation":"使用電熱墊或泡溫水澡有時能幫助緩解下背痛。","options":{"A":"polish","B":"relieve","C":"switch","D":"maintain"},"answer":"B","explanation":"help to ___ pain in the lower back；relieve pain／stress／pressure／symptoms（減輕不適的那一類）｜vt. 減輕, 解除","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0273","sourceId":"V0273","category":"vocab","year":99,"exam":"學測","stem":"Peter stayed up late last night, so he drank a lot of coffee this morning to keep himself _____ in class.","translation":"彼得昨晚熬夜了，所以今天早上喝了很多咖啡，好讓自己上課時保持清醒。","options":{"A":"acceptable","B":"amazed","C":"accurate","D":"awake"},"answer":"D","explanation":"to keep himself ___ in class；keep sb awake／stay awake／lie awake（awake 只放動詞後，不放名詞前）｜adj. 醒著的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0274","sourceId":"V0274","category":"vocab","year":99,"exam":"學測","stem":"Due to _______, prices for daily necessities have gone up and we have to pay more for the same items now.","translation":"由於通貨膨脹，民生必需品的價格上漲了，我們現在買同樣的東西得花更多錢。","options":{"A":"inflation","B":"solution","C":"objection","D":"condition"},"answer":"A","explanation":"｜n. 通貨膨脹, 膨脹","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0275","sourceId":"V0275","category":"vocab","year":99,"exam":"學測","stem":"The government is doing its best to ____ the cultures of the tribal people for fear that they may soon die out.","translation":"政府正竭盡全力保存原住民部落的文化，深怕這些文化很快就會消失。","options":{"A":"preserve","B":"frustrate","C":"hesitate","D":"overthrow"},"answer":"A","explanation":"doing its best to ___ the cultures of the tribal people；preserve culture／tradition／wildlife／food（保存原樣。preserved fruit 是蜜餞，protect 是防止傷害）｜v. 保存, 保護","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0276","sourceId":"V0276","category":"vocab","year":99,"exam":"學測","stem":"I could not ______ the sweet smell from the bakery, so I walked in and bought a fresh loaf of bread.","translation":"我抵擋不住麵包店飄出的香甜氣味，於是走進去買了一條新鮮麵包。","options":{"A":"insist","B":"resist","C":"obtain","D":"contain"},"answer":"B","explanation":"I could not ___ the sweet smell；can't resist + N／V-ing／resist temptation（接動名詞，不接 to V）｜v. 抵抗, 抗拒","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0277","sourceId":"V0277","category":"vocab","year":99,"exam":"學測","stem":"Steve has several meetings to attend every day; therefore, he has to work on a very _____ schedule.","translation":"史提夫每天都有好幾場會議要開，因此他的工作行程排得非常緊湊。","options":{"A":"dense","B":"various","C":"tight","D":"current"},"answer":"C","explanation":"he has to work on a very ___ schedule；a tight schedule／budget／deadline（行程很滿用 tight，不用 full）｜adj. 緊的, 緊湊的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0278","sourceId":"V0278","category":"vocab","year":99,"exam":"學測","stem":"Michael Phelps, an American swimmer, broke seven world records and won eight gold medals in men’s swimming _____ in the 2008 Olympics.","translation":"美國泳將麥可．菲爾普斯在 2008 年奧運男子游泳項目中打破七項世界紀錄，奪得八面金牌。","options":{"A":"drills","B":"techniques","C":"routines","D":"contests"},"answer":"D","explanation":"won eight gold medals in men’s swimming ___；enter／win a contest／a beauty contest（參賽用 enter，不用 join）｜n. 比賽, 競賽","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0279","sourceId":"V0279","category":"vocab","year":99,"exam":"學測","stem":"Those college students work at the orphanage on a _____ basis, helping the children with their studies without receiving any pay.","translation":"這些大學生在孤兒院擔任志工，無償協助孩子們的課業。","options":{"A":"voluntary","B":"competitive","C":"sorrowful","D":"realistic"},"answer":"A","explanation":"work at the orphanage on a ___ basis；on a voluntary／regular／daily／part-time basis（介系詞是 on，名詞用單數）｜adj. 自願的, 志願的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0280","sourceId":"V0280","category":"vocab","year":99,"exam":"學測","stem":"Studies show that asking children to do house _____, such as taking out the trash or doing the dishes, helps them grow into responsible adults.","translation":"研究顯示，讓孩子做家事，例如倒垃圾或洗碗，有助於他們成長為負責任的成年人。","options":{"A":"missions","B":"chores","C":"approaches","D":"incidents"},"answer":"B","explanation":"asking children to do house ___；do the chores／household chores（用複數，動詞是 do 不是 make）｜n. 雜務, 家事","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0281","sourceId":"V0281","category":"vocab","year":99,"exam":"學測","stem":"John has been scolded by his boss for over ten minutes now. _____, she is not happy about his being late again.","translation":"約翰已經被老闆罵了超過十分鐘，顯然她對他又遲到感到很不高興。","options":{"A":"Expressively","B":"Apparently","C":"Immediately","D":"Originally"},"answer":"B","explanation":"｜adv. 顯然, 看來","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0282","sourceId":"V0282","category":"vocab","year":99,"exam":"學測","stem":"Since the orange trees suffered _____ damage from a storm in the summer, the farmers are expecting a sharp decline in harvests this winter.","translation":"由於柳橙樹在夏季的暴風中受到嚴重損害，農民預期今年冬天的收成將大幅減少。","options":{"A":"potential","B":"relative","C":"severe","D":"mutual"},"answer":"C","explanation":"suffered ___ damage from a storm；severe damage／weather／shortage／pain（程度嚴重的那一類）｜adj. 嚴重的, 劇烈的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0283","sourceId":"V0283","category":"vocab","year":99,"exam":"學測","stem":"Typhoon Morakot claimed more than six hundred lives in early August of 2009, making it the most serious natural _____ in Taiwan in recent decades.","translation":"莫拉克颱風在 2009 年 8 月初奪走超過六百條人命，成為台灣近幾十年來最嚴重的天然災害。","options":{"A":"disaster","B":"barrier","C":"anxiety","D":"collapse"},"answer":"A","explanation":"making it the most serious natural ___ in Taiwan；a natural disaster／disaster relief／a disaster area（賑災是 disaster relief，不是 rescue）｜n. 災難, 災禍","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0284","sourceId":"V0284","category":"vocab","year":99,"exam":"學測","stem":"Robert was the only _____ to the car accident. The police had to count on him to find out exactly how the accident happened.","translation":"羅伯特是這場車禍唯一的目擊者，警方必須靠他才能查明事故確切的經過。","options":{"A":"dealer","B":"guide","C":"witness","D":"client"},"answer":"C","explanation":"Robert was the only ___ to the car accident；a witness to sth（介系詞是 to，不是 of）｜n. 目擊者, 證人","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0285","sourceId":"V0285","category":"vocab","year":99,"exam":"學測","stem":"Badly injured in the car accident, Jason could _____ move his legs and was sent to the hospital right away.","translation":"傑森在車禍中受了重傷，雙腿幾乎無法動彈，立刻被送往醫院。","options":{"A":"accordingly","B":"undoubtedly","C":"handily","D":"scarcely"},"answer":"D","explanation":"Jason could ___ move his legs；can／could scarcely + V（本身就是否定，不再加 not）｜adv. 幾乎不, 勉強","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0286","sourceId":"V0286","category":"vocab","year":100,"exam":"學測","stem":"All the new students were given one minute to _____ introduce themselves to the whole class.","translation":"所有新生都被給予一分鐘時間，向全班簡短地自我介紹。","options":{"A":"briefly","B":"famously","C":"gradually","D":"obviously"},"answer":"A","explanation":"one minute to ___ introduce themselves；briefly explain／describe／mention／summarize（用少少的話講完的動作。另有短暫地的意思，配 pause／appear）｜adv. 簡短地, 短暫地","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0287","sourceId":"V0287","category":"vocab","year":100,"exam":"學測","stem":"His dark brown jacket had holes in the elbows and had _____ to light brown, but he continued to wear it.","translation":"他那件深棕色的外套手肘處有破洞，顏色也褪成了淺棕色，但他仍然繼續穿著。","options":{"A":"cycled","B":"faded","C":"loosened","D":"divided"},"answer":"B","explanation":"had ___ to light brown；fade to + 顏色／faded jeans（褪成什麼顏色用 to。顏色退掉用 fade，不用 lose color）｜v. 褪色, 逐漸消失","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0288","sourceId":"V0288","category":"vocab","year":100,"exam":"學測","stem":"Everyone in our company enjoys working with Jason. He’s got all the qualities that make a _____ partner.","translation":"我們公司每個人都喜歡跟傑森共事，他具備了成為理想夥伴的所有特質。","options":{"A":"desirable","B":"comfortable","C":"frequent","D":"hostile"},"answer":"A","explanation":"qualities that make a ___ partner；a desirable partner（理想的合作對象）｜adj. 理想的, 令人嚮往的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0289","sourceId":"V0289","category":"vocab","year":100,"exam":"學測","stem":"Eyes are sensitive to light. Looking at the sun _____ could damage our eyes.","translation":"眼睛對光線很敏感，直視太陽可能會傷害我們的眼睛。","options":{"A":"hardly","B":"specially","C":"totally","D":"directly"},"answer":"D","explanation":"｜adv. 直接地, 直率地","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0290","sourceId":"V0290","category":"vocab","year":100,"exam":"學測","stem":"We were forced to _____ our plan for the weekend picnic because of the bad weather.","translation":"由於天氣惡劣，我們被迫取消了週末野餐的計畫。","options":{"A":"maintain","B":"record","C":"propose","D":"cancel"},"answer":"D","explanation":"｜v. 取消, 終止","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0291","sourceId":"V0291","category":"vocab","year":100,"exam":"學測","stem":"Three people are running for mayor. All three _____ seem confident that they will be elected, but we won’t know until the outcome of the election is announced.","translation":"有三個人在競選市長，三位候選人似乎都對自己當選很有信心，但結果要等選舉揭曉才會知道。","options":{"A":"particles","B":"receivers","C":"candidates","D":"containers"},"answer":"C","explanation":"All three ___ seem confident；a candidate for + 職位／a strong candidate（市長候選人是 a candidate for mayor，不用 of）｜n. 候選人, 應試者","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0292","sourceId":"V0292","category":"vocab","year":100,"exam":"學測","stem":"If you _____ a traffic law, such as drinking and driving, you may not drive for some time.","translation":"如果你違反交通法規，例如酒後駕車，你可能有一段時間不能開車。","options":{"A":"destroy","B":"violate","C":"attack","D":"invade"},"answer":"B","explanation":"If you ___ a traffic law；violate a law／human rights／sb's privacy（正式規章與權利用 violate，日常說 break the law）｜v. 違反, 違背","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0293","sourceId":"V0293","category":"vocab","year":100,"exam":"學測","stem":"Applying to college means sending in applications, writing study plans, and so on. It’s a long _____, and it makes students nervous.","translation":"申請大學意味著要遞交申請表、撰寫讀書計畫等等，這是一個漫長的過程，讓學生感到緊張。","options":{"A":"errand","B":"operation","C":"process","D":"display"},"answer":"C","explanation":"It’s a long ___；process data／information／applications（動詞的處理不是 deal。名詞另有 in the process of + V-ing）｜n. 過程, 程序","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0294","sourceId":"V0294","category":"vocab","year":100,"exam":"學測","stem":"Dr. Chu’s speech on the new energy source attracted great _____ from the audience at the conference.","translation":"朱博士關於新能源的演講，在會議上吸引了聽眾極大的關注。","options":{"A":"attention","B":"fortune","C":"solution","D":"influence"},"answer":"A","explanation":"attracted great ___ from the audience；attract／draw sb's attention 與 pay attention to（引起注意不用 cause，to 不能省）｜n. 注意, 注意力","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0295","sourceId":"V0295","category":"vocab","year":100,"exam":"學測","stem":"Everyone in the office must attend the meeting tomorrow. There are no _____ allowed.","translation":"辦公室裡的每個人明天都必須出席會議，不允許有任何例外。","options":{"A":"exceptions","B":"additions","C":"divisions","D":"measures"},"answer":"A","explanation":"There are no ___ allowed；make an exception／an exception to the rule（破例用 make，介系詞是 to 不是 of）｜n. 例外, 除外","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0296","sourceId":"V0296","category":"vocab","year":100,"exam":"學測","stem":"To make fresh lemonade, cut the lemon in half, _____ the juice into a bowl, and then add as much water and sugar as you like.","translation":"要做新鮮檸檬水，把檸檬切半，把汁擠進碗裡，再依喜好加入適量的水和糖。","options":{"A":"decrease","B":"squeeze","C":"freeze","D":"cease"},"answer":"B","explanation":"___ the juice into a bowl；squeeze a lemon／squeeze the juice out of（用力擠出汁。另有 the squeezed middle class，指被財務壓縮的一群）｜v. 擠, 擠壓","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0297","sourceId":"V0297","category":"vocab","year":100,"exam":"學測","stem":"Buddhism is the _____ religion in Thailand, with 90% of the total population identified as Buddhists.","translation":"佛教是泰國的主要宗教，全國人口中有 90%信奉佛教。","options":{"A":"racial","B":"competitive","C":"modest","D":"dominant"},"answer":"D","explanation":"Buddhism is the ___ religion；the dominant religion／language／culture（在競爭中占上風而成為主流，單純的主要用 main）｜adj. 主要的, 佔優勢的","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0298","sourceId":"V0298","category":"vocab","year":100,"exam":"學測","stem":"When I open a book, I look first at the table of _____ to get a general idea of the book and to see which chapters I might be interested in reading.","translation":"我打開一本書時，會先看目錄，藉此大致了解書的內容，並看看自己對哪些章節感興趣。","options":{"A":"contracts","B":"contents","C":"contests","D":"contacts"},"answer":"B","explanation":"at the table of ___；the table of contents／the contents of a book（目錄一定用複數，單數 content 是滿足或含量）｜n. 目錄, 內容","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0299","sourceId":"V0299","category":"vocab","year":100,"exam":"學測","stem":"The children were so _____ to see the clown appear on stage that they laughed, screamed, and clapped their hands happily.","translation":"孩子們看到小丑登台時非常高興，又笑又叫，還開心地拍手。","options":{"A":"admirable","B":"fearful","C":"delighted","D":"intense"},"answer":"C","explanation":"were so ___ to see the clown appear on stage；be delighted to V／be delighted with sth（很高興…。名詞 delight 另有 take delight in V-ing）｜adj. 高興的, 欣喜的；v. 使高興","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"},{"id":"sv-V0300","sourceId":"V0300","category":"vocab","year":100,"exam":"學測","stem":"Typhoon Maggie brought to I-lan County a huge amount of rainfall, much greater than the _____ rainfall of the season in the area.","translation":"瑪姬颱風為宜蘭縣帶來大量降雨，遠超過當地這個季節的平均雨量。","options":{"A":"average","B":"considerate","C":"promising","D":"enjoyable"},"answer":"A","explanation":"than the ___ rainfall；an average student／city／above average／on average（中等程度不用 normal 或 ordinary，平均而言是 on average）｜adj. 平均的；n. 平均數","origin":"https://staresto-create.github.io/JCEE-vocab-questions/gsat/","credit":"staresto-create ZZSH"}]};
